WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In a laboratory, people can miss a second target because attention is still occupied by the first.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers later studied intensive meditation training and found changes on that task. But they did not test a twelve-minute recording.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Zen12 sells a structured library of audio sessions. That can be a convenience, not a proven shortcut to an hour of meditation.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Before you pay, try a simple twelve-minute focus session without an app. Write down what changes.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Then compare format, evidence, price and refund terms.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
An honest guide should work even when you choose not to buy.
